Chapter: ScheduleMidnight
  cites Foreword chapter Schedule
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 Searching past midnight moves the weekday and the day of month with the
 clock: from Saturday 31 January at 23:50, a schedule for Sundays at 00:15
 and one for the 1st at 00:15 both match in 25 minutes, and one for
 Saturdays at 00:15 does not match within the day.

Section: Body

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("sunday " & show (sched-next (WeeklyOn 0 0 15) 0 6 31 31 23 50)
      & " first " & show (sched-next (MonthlyOn 1 0 15) 0 6 31 31 23 50)
      & " saturday " & show (sched-next (WeeklyOn 6 0 15) 0 6 31 31 23 50))
  end